{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51762","headline":"诗 · 淘沙子","name":"诗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"九重城里人中贵，五等诸侯阃外尊。\n争似布衣云水客，不将名字挂乾坤。\n（同上）（〖1〗《全蜀艺文志》卷二三、《全唐诗》卷七六一收此诗爲丁元和作，《全五代诗》卷六十云丁元和号淘沙子。\n《茅亭客话》卷四载丁元和事迹较详，与卷三所载之淘沙子似非一人。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"淘沙子","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51762.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51762","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}